# --- Data ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw TLC parquet (~600 MB/year) is never committed: download_tlc.py re-fetches it
# by URL. Everything derived from it IS committed on purpose — external inputs
# (weather, events, zone shapefile) and the processed tables (demand, features,
# zone policy, centroids, a streamed sample) total ~30 MB and are what lets every
# reported number be re-checked, and every demo run, straight from a clone
# without Spark or the download. Streaming checkpoints are runtime state.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/external/taxi_zones.zip
**/_checkpoints/

# --- Models & reports -------------------------------------------------------
# Committed on purpose: the saved models and report artifacts ARE the submitted
# results, and all of them are small (the largest, reports/geojson, is ~25 MB).
# Parquet checksum noise (*.crc, _SUCCESS) is still excluded globally below.

# --- Spark / Ivy ------------------------------------------------------------
.ivy2/
spark-warehouse/
metastore_db/
derby.log
*.crc
_SUCCESS
checkpoint/
**/_checkpoints/
**/_checkpoints_live/

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Runtime markers --------------------------------------------------------
.stream_ready
gui/stream_state.json

# --- Editors / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Launcher scratch -------------------------------------------------------
*.log

# --- Local working notes, not part of the submission ------------------------
QA_PREP.md
.venv-*/
